# Golden (node 0700 additive ABI): the kChordFollowed announce event.
# Proves the GUI harmony-visualizer contract: a manual `chord play` publishes
# EXACTLY ONE {"ev":"chord-followed",...,"src":"manual"} line on the genuine
# change, and NO chord-followed line is emitted on the many ticks where the
# followed chord does not change (a whole style plays for two bars here without
# a single extra chord-followed line), nor on a repeated identical chord.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
style load pop
style route drums synth:10
play C
transport start
advance 960
play C
advance 960
quit
